#: ../../source/docs/install-firmware.rst:5
#: 896ebaab157545b79ac685eb507c53fd
msgid "Install Firmware"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/install-firmware.rst:7
#: 8dbea858f5604cb4b6bfdca996b7e303
msgid "This article explains how to use APM Planner 2 to program your Autopilot with the latest APM firmware."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/install-firmware.rst:11
#: 242a44ab5e224819a7fb277f32603ef3
msgid "1 Connect autopilot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/install-firmware.rst:13
#: 65e8ff4ed4d840c09ba156de12016f83
msgid "Connect the autopilot to your computer with a micro-USB cable. Don't select Connect yet; APM Planner can only load firmware while it displays Disconnected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/install-firmware.rst:21
#: 285f0f742558449a8d48fe2e9a6f37fd
msgid "2 Select Initial Setup and Install Firmware. Then select your vehicle type."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/install-firmware.rst:26
#: 2e7f01b19e2c4757968040690bb55488
msgid "APM Planner will notify you when the status bar reaches 100% and the firmware installation in complete."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/install-firmware.rst:33
#: ef86fec921c64744a1c0c0dbd7d9ffd4
msgid "3 (Pixhawk) Power cycle and listen for the tone."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/install-firmware.rst:35
#: 91abc9b8fae64a6b8cbf25afe540731e
msgid "After the firmware installation is complete, power cycle your vehicle by disconnecting and reconnecting the USB. Listen for the tone! If you hear a musical tone, your firmware installation is complete. If you hear a tone followed by three beeps, disconnect the USB. Reconnect the USB while holding down the safety button. You will hear several tone sequences followed by two beeps. This indicates your firmware installation is complete."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/install-firmware.rst:44
#: fd83476a93204072929deafca23d6d6a
msgid "4 Beta firmware"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/install-firmware.rst:46
#: bf12913d6df54123b80a53454357f4fd
msgid "If you are an experienced tester looking to download a beta version of developing firmware, select beta to view the available beta firmwares."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/install-firmware.rst:50
#: 793a03e75fd84899a5c0647d56692ec1
msgid "You may need to put APM Planner 2.0 in Advanced Mode by selecting File -> Advanced in the menu to show the extra options"
msgstr ""
